{{!-- Shared ship-component row (bead uc08, round 5): ONE anatomy for
     starship component rows on the Refit tab (installed components) and
     the Combat tab (merged component roster). Anatomy: name (opens the
     item sheet) · status badge · condensed cost chip ("P1 S3 SP-" for
     consumers, "G45 S10 SP+1" for generators — computed in the sheet
     context), then the @partial-block for tab-specific actions (Refit:
     weapon-slot select + remove anchor; Combat: Emergency Repair button
     + GM state chips).
     Hash: id, name, state (SHIP_COMPONENT_STATES vocabulary, book p223 —
     also keys the status-badge colour class), stateLabel (localized
     STATE_* string; OMIT on the Combat roster — its state chips are the
     status display there), cost (the condensed P/G/S/SP string).
     Status-badge colour code is FIXED here and styled once in the ship
     section of css/sheet-gear.css: intact = muted, unpowered = muted-deep,
     damaged = amber warn, destroyed = danger-alarm. --}}
<div class="inv-row ship-component-row"{{#if id}} data-item-id="{{id}}"{{/if}}>
    <span class="inv-name sc-name" data-action="openItem" data-item-id="{{id}}"
        data-tooltip="{{localize "GEAR.OPEN_SHEET"}}" title="{{name}}">{{name}}</span>
    {{#if stateLabel}}<span class="chip sc-state {{state}}">{{stateLabel}}</span>{{/if}}
    <span class="chip origin-mod sc-cost">{{cost}}</span>
    {{> @partial-block}}
</div>